      "widgets_values": [
        "Restore this exact Fallout 1 brass knuckles inventory icon as a detailed prerendered 2D game asset. Preserve the original silhouette, oblique isometric projection, position, proportions and framing. Exactly four rounded finger holes form the curved lower-right row, with one broad solid palm brace across the upper-left back. Preserve all four empty transparent finger holes, the visible thickness of their rounded steel rims and the long flat back brace. The Fallout item is hardened steel: use dark worn steel with muted warm brown patina, tiny scratches, restrained edge highlights and subtle surface pitting. Keep the original warm upper-left lighting and late-1990s Fallout appearance. Remove pixel dithering and reveal coherent metal detail without changing the geometry. Keep a single connected intact piece with smooth forged contours. No spikes, blades, extra holes, extra parts, logos, inscriptions, hands, background, pedestal, scene or cast shadow. Do not make shiny yellow gold or polished brass. One item only. Preserve transparent background and generous clear margins. All item pixels must stay within the reference item area.",
